      "message": "I think my naming was a little misleading. This is really an intermediates directory for a specific mixed build action and not the true sandbox directory, which is `out/soong/.temp/sbox/\u003csome_hash\u003e`. `sbox` will cleanup `out/soong/.temp/sbox/\u003csome_hash\u003e` after building.\n\nThis intermediate directory should also likely be per action since `RuleBuilder + sbox` wipes it out before building https://cs.android.com/android/_/android/platform/build/soong/+/4d9dbdab7a8a5b0074805b4861aca2129320b044:android/rule_builder.go;l\u003d134-139;drc\u003dd079e0b2708ce0f4cce470db929f28dd8d2b0e80;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d0\n\n(I have updated the variable and function names, and also relevant comments)",
